我可以消耗 10 点能量为你的斗篷注入力量。即使你脱下斗篷，效果也应当继续维持。\n不过，我建议你仍将它随身携带，以防有什么东西设法消除你身上的效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1a0ba91e79d2c2c248d1d50f4e630736d8fb105ce367118a54d47752525b9f03","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"81546ed83215f8dc2ab82b0e28279fb6a50f22bf46cac30be0b8fe2911c2a3db","logical_entry_identity":"809fa9deeb12ac7b386481c0b18e4d2900505c124ff0253de36fb59ba60ec576","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some walk in shadow, alone, unloved, unwanted. What powers they wield may be mighty, but their names are forever cursed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们是一群漫步于阴影中、孤独的、讨人厌的、被遗弃的人。他们的力量或许很强大，但他们的名字永远被诅咒着。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"446377c75d14117e890eac81e7df6787eacc2a259a7d0964be90a267f33ca321","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"815814784252767bf43c3a27b598756cdb902abcc6b3e3402c285277089a7ede","logical_entry_identity":"06e257f88e79f7062eda28b599a5808af0d6af239d440983a361c610180064b5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"In the Age of Pyre the orcs learned the secrets of magic, and with their newfound powers nearly overcame the whole of Maj'Eyal.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"在烈火纪，兽人学到了魔法的奥秘，他们恐怖的魔法力量差一点毁灭了整个埃亚尔大陆。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8c711f228f84b773e3af275c1879ed69784abebd352a833efa192dd832a1afd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8158c3037909d1cb3bdf20a405b912b12ed6098f14a9f3a23a7e375f6de91973","logical_entry_identity":"4bfd6816ee29118bae8db25a02b6118f7b5eb075d5d29e19a63716cdd3dbea63","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You can not use the Orb with foes watching (#Target# to the %s%s)","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"你不能在有敌人的情况下使用水晶球(#Target#在%s%s)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2bd390a86abff61e2ee04b844c4ff56d884bcda576c8a2e9909414fb7174c788","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"815d4e523952eb9c25ff8bc3ddc8de4f052714c3c6bb0282ffd4ac3f5f398e0e","logical_entry_identity":"d352845ac70fd4bf49a487aa71c9ce3970b34247458658d164061db019b01b4e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I thought there might be some treasure to be had around here.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我以为能在这里捞到些财宝。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"088911cd75ab7a241cf633117c8472831994d54496392bc04a683f42f8bcada8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"81615ad2d10e4cdd2b43be8091c1f939afeb262cad0978f8240df2b89dd4be9d","logical_entry_identity":"5cd2e07d5831c739068cb09ddd6909e9021dcb30b3929b64185cfd53a2f7f3a2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Infusion: Primal","source_tag":"talent name","target":"纹身：原初"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"354fc16f17cde8c085b33e65d95254650c2121477aa749e0b0681d1586c69775","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"81619a55711195856d7ae027d54fc596892555796cb05dc308ed0f2ac917ff1e","logical_entry_identity":"387b77f373b94f9641ef7c6ec396039a3a3ccff8f791a54747e85bc3b0c558ab","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is energized by the cold while wearing the Frost Treads, gaining 20%% increased cold damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标穿着踏雪时受到寒冷的激励，增加 20%% 的寒冷伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5710c213d673ff03ad842deaeeddad655e2c62daabca833bda64731f879a706d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8161d37642846229a46ec5d5ee2c045397948be029a90c169845d365152c9042","logical_entry_identity":"4064d594770c20c2cd245df4c9160f798549cdb446e2b7e90690a3c53d38ccde","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is taking %0.2f physical damage each turn. If they die while under this effect, they will explode!","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标每回合受到 %0.2f 物理伤害。在这个状态下死亡时，会发生爆炸！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"49bcfe8ae4162416455ad311cd4374ca034dc82467cbc77163e736a61da83662","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8162cfd71448b4f7aa48e07a119cd53b32327b26a8f62562ca54f678a8cffd8d","logical_entry_identity":"fad53f34447fd2ef1c0f9e01312f936cb549fb6548af139e9782b3919edd28c0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou are an Ogre, hailing from Elvala.\n\nYou face contempt and fear from a world your kind have never wronged, and the Spellhunt would have eradicated your race entirely, had the Shalore not shown sympathy and granted your ancestors refuge in Elvala.\nNowadays, your people are beginning to shake their old image, but that's not why you've set out for adventure; you've learned of countless problems facing your world, and you intend to fix them yourself.\nYour kind were made for combat and hard work, and Maj'Eyal needs a lot of both.  \n\nYou have come to the north of the Shaloren capital city of Elvala, in search of the Scintillating Caves. It is infested with vermin and seemingly alive crystals.\nTo the west lies another dangerous place: a camp of Rhaloren. They are renegade Shaloren who do not wish to restrict their magic usage. Stopping them would be good for the world in general, but especially for your Shaloren benefactors.\n\nAfter days of travel, you have found the caves and entered it. What will you find there...?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#。\n\n你是一名食人魔，来自埃尔瓦拉。\n\n你面临着来自一个从未被你的同族伤害过的世界的轻蔑和恐惧；若非永恒精灵表示同情并允许你的祖先在埃尔瓦拉避难，魔法狩猎本会将你的种族彻底灭绝。\n如今，你的同族开始摆脱旧有形象，但这并不是你踏上冒险之路的原因；你得知这个世界正面临着无数问题，并打算亲自解决它们。\n你的种族生来就是为战斗和苦工而造就的，现在马基·埃亚尔大陆正需要这些。\n\n你来到了永恒精灵首都埃尔瓦拉北部，寻找闪光洞穴，那里被害虫和看似有生命的水晶所侵扰。\n西部还有一个危险的地方：罗兰精灵营地。他们是永恒精灵的叛徒，不愿限制魔法的使用。阻止他们总体上有益于这个世界，尤其有益于庇护你们的永恒精灵恩人。\n\n经过几天的旅行，你发现并进入了那些洞穴，你会发现什么呢？\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fb48ca67dcba66bac8ae84d30b32b2ec7acfec7a0ea338b4efd8afd79d74fedc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"816437690efd610f1afa35cf880ded15a7bac57335d2456bb0aa5aa5b4598ec4","logical_entry_identity":"bb8e54ec1daa76f36c3314cb16ed5eb616d7a6d59f6659194835b1460cd54407","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Weave darkness (power %d) in a radius of %d, blocking all light but the most powerful and teleporting you a short range.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"织就强度为 %d、半径为 %d 格的黑暗，遮蔽除最强光线之外的所有光线，并将你短距离传送。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"86fed3ad84ab7b45484a55f056aad80408c81b4db1e8682f9f650bc560e0566e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8167c38b864bc2352e05fe51045202f08cfa613b064ddd007d6396bfa06e27e4","logical_entry_identity":"1cf75645f24a0237bdf5daaada6755b13455b8f3aec822d9907d8d1f0519199d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#\nHere lies the merchant Dalio\n#{normal}#83 - 121#{italic}#\nSlain by an assassin's deadly poison\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#\n此处安葬着商人达里奥\n#{normal}#83 - 121#{italic}#\n死于刺客的致命毒药\n#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a16f43f7d8e8c7defc00e0cbb19d0c8afac949351950b4675a0bd6a38050a838","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"816c17edf146c5b4a0f08fe2849b7dbd75f60ea935dedbd3e7071d66ce933ec5","logical_entry_identity":"6c9a678e5702e7eb2e25aa46849faad2dfc896d27c60dba799d60240851715ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Quick Shot","source_tag":"talent name","target":"快速射击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2631836491c2eb3be7294d168f6cff221dca6e344ad97d4246b02794acf7d226","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"816dfedf8f5798c8f91484f32b2900768fa334a271c1ac009e027e8dbff32d68","logical_entry_identity":"28084255f89cb4afc7737fd6b78348743615255c342604834f4f2b0b3026a638","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Generic talent tree","source_tag":"_t","target":"通用技能树"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"58663b16ed28c6a489d999f92c00597788a26eb036a5af68ba319078212924fd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"816f8aada07281af5c650e7daa5360452373ce74ce4e8488c59449c1c005a633","logical_entry_identity":"a5521e55802a630b899ccccb2e0c224290ee4cca0aff5572dc51bd0eb77bd387","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Entrance to the orc breeding pit","source_tag":"_t","target":"兽人育种棚的入口"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fec6a64b9eeb891d2aa498808034cd202178f9ecf6bf3c6d54cfc941f9d7366e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"817280b3da6f8defa9d326bd12fccb940720b5f35a81247d8682ecf80058c298","logical_entry_identity":"858fcecb8a5cb586c5331870249dad47513416b7e98c5efa8faac1cc616f805e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This deep red sword weeps blood continuously. It was born in the labs of the orcish corrupter Hurik, who sought to make a crystal that would house his soul after death. But his plans were disrupted by a band of sun paladins, and though most died purging his keep of dread minions, their leader Raasul fought through to Hurik's lab, sword in hand. There the two did battle, blade against blood magic, till both fell to the floor with weeping wounds. The orc with his last strength crawled towards his fashioned phylactery, hoping to save himself, but Raasul saw his plans and struck the crystal with his light-bathed sword. It shattered, and in the sudden impulse of energies the steel, crystal and blood were fused into one.\nNow the broken fragments of Raasul's soul are trapped in this terrible artifact, his mind warped beyond all sanity by decades of imprisonment. Only the taste of blood calls him forth, his soul stealing the lifeblood of others to take on physical form again, that he may thrash and wail against the living.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这把深红色的剑不断的向下滴血。它诞生于兽人堕落者胡里克的实验室。最初，胡里克寻找了一枚水晶来制造他的命匣，但他的计划很快被一群太阳骑士打断，尽管大部分骑士死于不死军团的阻拦，但骑士团团长瑞苏尔却单枪匹马杀入了胡里克的实验室。在那里，两位强者展开了对决，利剑与血魔法你来我往，直到他们都重伤倒地。兽人想拼尽最后一分力气，拿到他的命匣，希望能拯救自己，但是瑞苏尔识破了他的阴谋，挥起沐浴着圣光的利剑击碎了水晶。命匣破碎的瞬间，钢铁、水晶与鲜血融为了一体。\n如今，瑞苏尔残破的灵魂被困在这件可怕的造物中，数十年的囚禁早已扭曲了他的心智。只有鲜血的味道能唤醒他，他的灵魂窃取他人的生命之血以重获形体，好向生者咆哮哀嚎。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e4ac0c3b403de7c985a85f28f8778894472b2ea0de20a2284982b5739d76dee5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"817840771c2b11324fd276991536417e43079881ea9158c37ebce6a0b2a080e9","logical_entry_identity":"75cbc75fc6778c1582a4118042521236b271ce3bb5747ee3ba4977f15f7ad852","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Contain your impatience while I prepare these. I'll have the elixir within the hour.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在我调配这些原料时收敛好你的急躁。一小时内我就能备好药剂。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6309ea298d9f8fe121edd597f51e7c74a3b608d88928d638ef44f420e6a36870","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8179a8f9dd475554c780ef09733e9d73d3c48caaee8914bbc58c7c4964c53697","logical_entry_identity":"501eb4074ff86a58b052fdb2be075cd4a9bcd8b75117d31ae2f8d3ec22cfd5e3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Soothing Darkness","source_tag":"talent name","target":"黑暗亲和"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc295e16a7a09632b3abb5efcdb1903a55f50c0c47a8be0d0fc8ce945259d7f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"817bd1e5cc11f43eebfa8e8857e27004fdb1fd75eae5a876714cd2ec3ed24542","logical_entry_identity":"c9362ab8b9c504a0ec69a8203185945a7c1c446c9ad87aada801e6693a778306","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Slumber","source_tag":"_t","target":"+沉睡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8aa0d3fa56074c354f76ee199e4853b8c3c6894875d15be4cab19470be11467f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"817fb0618393841865fe26ca1344d812b4c36f230eb8a02fbb7503d3275f0e4e","logical_entry_identity":"3f0ab97094eabe849cc8673f35476e0a4c35de62aa710000860488027e3c93bc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This sounds strange. I need to think about it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"听起来有点奇怪，我要考虑一下。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"42870e84d8bbe60016d52e90332c29cedd2911c1a5703ccdc1b1aebd27d04a80","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8185e92a8bb33ae2ed5aedf86dff8d3936d738fbe75becd86e676fb349299f50","logical_entry_identity":"ac015760995c2f3a254b09f2bf2c5a6a89e48c86a68a926cb0b35afe1e9eb637","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s flips %s %s over...","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s翻转了%s%s…"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a0ffed9e71578c14fd9e5af64bba2471675c2f81a82b3300b51a40f3a159fa2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"818b4a745e3c429e800e61213ae6152065f321a88984dbe2856e615031791d00","logical_entry_identity":"824a916423be94a71ae5ca2b0297e0ee6c220be1ea1af1a88371145e26b45f28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Healing Inversion","source_tag":"talent name","target":"治疗逆转"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"42f7eb1155ccabe73a1fcd46c90a86de659f9c6072725b810c410c780e5ff9ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"818c56e5d5c30fc06923ab74f70480a2cc99fb6cd29e931f9e2d26d3e8e9e375","logical_entry_identity":"3dd4fe18bd0dab0463b15b16a0f3a2fe55f90a324bab94164bfb2c9d12193bb0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"There are two main groups in the population here, Humans and Elves.\nHumans came here in the Age of Pyre. Our ancestors were part of a Mardrop expedition to find what had happened to the Naloren lands that sunk under the sea. Their ship was wrecked and the survivors landed on this continent.\nThey came across a group of elves, seemingly native to those lands, and befriended them - founding the Sunwall and the Gates of Morning.\nThen the orc pride came and we have been fighting for our survival ever since.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这里主要有两个种族，人类和精灵。\n人类在烈火纪便来到了这里。我们的祖先是马卓普探险队的一部分人员，他们是去调查沉入海底的纳鲁精灵大陆秘密的。他们的船失事沉没，侥幸活下来的人就漂流到了这块大陆。\n他们碰到了一群精灵，似乎是这块大陆的原住民，他们成为了朋友并一起生活，创建了太阳堡垒和晨曦之门。\n后来兽人来到了这里，从那时开始我们就一直与他们战斗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ce1140123a4fc5014c92139eabe1fcedce84ffec4b77631883196b5583a07ca3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"818cbbb877d904e3169b5bf9fa31c8dddd9edbfb42ca189c13ed7f7020907b02","logical_entry_identity":"a35e81819f529307d4311b127fd8c01da6a3dbd972fef36fe61f3c53ba0dd443","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You fire a disabling shot at a target's throat (or equivalent), dealing %d%% weapon damage and silencing them for %d turns.\nIf the target is marked, you consume the mark to fire two secondary shots at their arms and legs (or other appendages) dealing %d%% damage, reducing their movement speed by 50%% and disarming them for the duration.\nThe status chance increases with your Accuracy.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你朝目标的喉咙（或者类似部位）射击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害并沉默 %d 回合。\n如果目标被标记，则消耗标记并额外向目标的手臂与大腿（或者类似部位）射击两次，造成 %d%% 伤害，降低其 50 %% 移动速度，同时使其不能使用武器。\n状态效果几率受命中加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ce86dbf81af1b08362aaa83eb85b740009391104d435bc40a6bdba1f32c13903","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8194393310197f288146ab1587e04d79d1122ce0348fee83e20c79d092454bc5","logical_entry_identity":"0979b4c4ce515abfd16272b9ea8d57d8e6f652c7fb0a0d998009a11af7fde5a8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Become a whirling storm of blades, increasing attack speed by %d%% and causing melee attacks to strike an additional adjacent target other than your primary target for %d%% weapon damage. \nThis talent is exhausting to use, draining 4 stamina each turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"化作剑刃旋风，攻击速度提高 %d%%，并使近战攻击对主目标以外的一名相邻目标造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n维持此技能十分耗费体力，每回合消耗 4 点体力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"82561f96137b0aef1721af0af1e3f8e237c2c60abc174ad586605338415a1041","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8196864ff40afdeed6dd96b9ff827e5c8fc8cb654604861f3fdab768e44f12ba","logical_entry_identity":"a461e317a72f7427632f0ef3937c37a42e0e5acf796c6319308304de76788a1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The telekinetically-wielded gem grants you +%d stats.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"念动宝石增加你 %d 属性。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}}